<title>HONG KONG: W.I. Carr appoints Taylor chief economist.</title>
<headline>W.I. Carr appoints Taylor chief economist.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W.I. Carr Securities said on Friday it has appointed Michael Taylor as chief economist responsible for the firm's economic research products encompassing both equity and debt markets.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
